" itself, twice a second, so Thermaestro needn't ask for them one at a "
"time. Copy the file to a USB stick and load it in the pump's USB menu "
"(7.2). The pump is particular about sticks: those larger than 4 GB, or "
"made in about the last 15 years, often aren't accepted. Everything works "
"without it, more slowly."
